      <div class="article__main">
        <div class="article__body prose">
          <blockquote>
<ul>
<li><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Leonida is the US state where GTA 6 is set. It has <strong>6 regions</strong>, <strong>170+ animal species</strong> and <strong>hurricanes</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>Each region has its own look</strong>, from city streets to swamps to a national park. The names and details are hidden in spoiler boxes below.</li>
<li><strong>Rockstar has not announced</strong> region sizes, borders or fast travel.</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Words used on this page.</strong> <em>Region</em> is a large area of the map. <em>Spoiler box</em> is a box you open if you want that detail.</p>
<h2 id="what-is-leonida" tabindex="-1">What is Leonida?</h2>
<p>Leonida is a made-up US state. USA Today calls it the series’ take on Florida. Rockstar’s tagline is “Vice City, USA. The darkest side of the sunniest place in America.” Its nickname is “the Goodtime State”. For size, see the <a href="map.md">map page</a>.</p>
<h2 id="the-regions-at-a-glance" tabindex="-1">The regions at a glance</h2>
<p>Open the box for the names and what each is known for.</p>
<details class="spoiler"><summary class="spoiler__summary"><span class="spoiler__label">All 6 regions and what each is known for (names only, no story)</span><span class="spoiler__hint" aria-hidden="true">tap to reveal</span></summary><div class="spoiler__body" data-pagefind-ignore>
<div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Table"><table class="table">
