<td>The big city, with neon-lit streets</td>
<td>Rockstar, Forbes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Leonida Keys</strong></td>
<td>A chain of islands. Rockstar’s character page puts Jason “in the Keys”.</td>
<td>Rockstar, Forbes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Grassrivers</strong></td>
<td>A wetland: mangroves and alligators</td>
<td>PC Gamer (quoting Rockstar’s site), Forbes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Port Gellhorn</strong></td>
<td>A coastal region, called “Leonida’s forgotten coast”</td>
<td>PC Gamer (quoting Rockstar’s site)</td>
</tr>
