<h2 id="named-places" tabindex="-1">Named places</h2>
<details class="spoiler"><summary class="spoiler__summary"><span class="spoiler__label">Places named in official store text (no story)</span><span class="spoiler__hint" aria-hidden="true">tap to reveal</span></summary><div class="spoiler__body" data-pagefind-ignore>
<ul>
<li><strong>Gambit Bay</strong>: a place for fishing.</li>
<li><strong>Washington Beach</strong>: where the Shitzu Squalo boat is docked.</li>
<li><strong>Watson Bay</strong>: has the Paradise Garage, with a weapon locker and a place to drop off stolen goods.</li>
<li><strong>Mount Kalaga</strong>: backwoods for off-road driving.</li>
<li><strong>Southside Vice City</strong>: home to the PTT Youngin$ Compound.</li>
<li><strong>Stockyard</strong>: home to Stock 305 and Electric Fang Tattoo.</li>
<li><strong>Lake Leonida</strong>: home to One-Eyed Willie’s mod shop.</li>
<li><strong>Ocean Beach</strong> and <strong>Shore Drive</strong>: named in the Vintage Vice City Pack and '95 Grotti Cheetah text (per Polygon).</li>
</ul>
<p>The store text does not always say which region a place is in, so we have not guessed.</p>
</div></details>
