<h2 id="weather-animals-and-activities" tabindex="-1">Weather, animals and activities</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Weather:</strong> rain, sun and wind are local and keep going. Hurricanes are in the game. (Game Informer, via Forbes)</li>
<li><strong>Animals:</strong> 170+ species, sorted as Rare, Discoverable and Legendary. 60+ are birds. 30+ are land animals. (Forbes)</li>
<li><strong>Activities named in previews:</strong> base jumping, scuba diving, kayaking, airboats, jet skis, racing on and off road, billiards, hiking dates, gyms, zoos, mini golf. (Forbes)</li>
<li><strong>How often hurricanes hit, where to find Legendary animals, and what rewards you get:</strong> not announced.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="not-announced" tabindex="-1">Not announced</h2>
<ul>
<li>Exact region sizes and borders</li>
<li>Fast travel and map markers</li>
<li>Which region each named place is in</li>
</ul>
