<h2 id="faq" tabindex="-1">FAQ</h2>
<h3 id="what-is-leonida-1" tabindex="-1">What is Leonida?</h3>
<p>A made-up US state based on Florida. It is where GTA 6 takes place.</p>
<h3 id="how-many-regions-does-leonida-have" tabindex="-1">How many regions does Leonida have?</h3>
<p>Six. The names are in the spoiler box.</p>
<h3 id="is-vice-city-the-only-city" tabindex="-1">Is Vice City the only city?</h3>
<p>No. Vice City is one of six regions.</p>
<h3 id="are-there-hurricanes-in-gta-6" tabindex="-1">Are there hurricanes in GTA 6?</h3>
<p>Yes. How often is not announced.</p>
